{"id":"0d5859a5ef0a16af","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/562_混合逻辑_Hybrid_Logic.md","title":"562 混合逻辑 Hybrid Logic","display":"562_混合逻辑_Hybrid_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}=\\{i_k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}=\\{i_k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{sat}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{sat}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,i,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A,@_iA\">\\(p,i,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A,@_iA\\)</span>。派生记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\">\\(A\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\">\\(\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\">\\(i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\">\\(i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}(i,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\operatorname{sat}(i,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由名字与替换\">3. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>命题变元函数类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题变元函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(i)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(i)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(@_iA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(@_iA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{562}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>名元出现函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NV}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Nom}_{562})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NV}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Nom}_{562})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(p)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(i)=\\{i\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(p)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(i)=\\{i\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(@_iA)=\\{i\\}\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(@_iA)=\\{i\\}\\cup\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{562})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{562})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{562}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{562}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,562}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,562}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}_{562}=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}_{562}=\\operatorname{NV}_{562}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{562}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{562})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{562}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{562})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{562}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{562}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(i,\\sigma)=i,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(i,\\sigma)=i,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(@_iA,\\sigma)=@_i\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(@_iA,\\sigma)=@_i\\operatorname{Sub}_{562}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>下列三个命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{562}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{562}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{562}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{562}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{562}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{562}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为使常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 的经典行为不依赖未给出的定义，另取</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{562}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{562}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>盒分配公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{562}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{562}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>混合公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{562}\n=\n\\{@_i i:i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{562}\n=\n\\{@_i i:i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat1}^{562}\n=\n\\{@_i(A\\to B)\\to(@_iA\\to@_iB):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat1}^{562}\n=\n\\{@_i(A\\to B)\\to(@_iA\\to@_iB):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat2}^{562}\n=\n\\{@_iA\\to(i\\to A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat2}^{562}\n=\n\\{@_iA\\to(i\\to A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bridge}^{562}\n=\n\\{(i\\land\\Diamond j)\\to(@_jA\\to\\Diamond A):i,j\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bridge}^{562}\n=\n\\{(i\\land\\Diamond j)\\to(@_jA\\to\\Diamond A):i,j\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{562}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat1}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat2}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bridge}^{562}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{562}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat1}^{562}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat2}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bridge}^{562}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Name 规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\n=\n\\{((i\\to A),A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},\\ i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\n=\n\\{((i\\to A),A):i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},\\ i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相应的规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (\\mathsf{MP}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (\\mathsf{Nec}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{i\\to A}{A}\\ (\\mathsf{Name}),\\quad i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (\\mathsf{MP}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (\\mathsf{Nec}),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{i\\to A}{A}\\ (\\mathsf{Name}),\\quad i\\notin\\operatorname{NV}_{562}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则总关系是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{562}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\n\\subseteq \\mathsf{Frm}_{562}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{562}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\n\\subseteq \\mathsf{Frm}_{562}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{562}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{562}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义末行函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{562}((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\n=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{562}((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\n=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{562}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{562}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{562}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\bigl(\\operatorname{last}_{562}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{562}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{562}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{562}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{562}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-行证书\">8. 行证书</h1>\n<p>定义完整推导证书集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{562}\n=\\{(\\Gamma,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}(\\Gamma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{562}\n=\\{(\\Gamma,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}(\\Gamma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证书中的每一行理由及其见证行号均由第 6 节的五个互斥标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{ax},\\mathsf{mp},\\mathsf{nec},\\mathsf{name}\">\\(\\mathsf{hyp},\\mathsf{ax},\\mathsf{mp},\\mathsf{nec},\\mathsf{name}\\)</span> 给出；其中 Name 行的空依赖条件与新鲜名元条件已是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{562}\\)</span> 的成员条件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-混合-Kripke-语义载体与后承\">9. 混合 Kripke 语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>混合模型集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HMod}_{562}\n=\n\\{(W,R,g,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W,\\ g:\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\to W,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{HMod}_{562}\n=\n\\{(W,R,g,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W,\\ g:\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\to W,\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{562}\">\\(M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{562}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{562}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{562}\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\Longleftrightarrow w=g(i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{562}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{562}\\operatorname{nom}(i)\\Longleftrightarrow w=g(i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\not\\models_{562}\\bot,\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{562}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{562}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\not\\models_{562}\\bot,\n\\qquad\nM,w\\models_{562}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{562}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{562}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{562}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{562}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{562}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{562}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{562}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{562}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{562}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{562}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{562}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{562}@_iA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,g(i)\\models_{562}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{562}@_iA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,g(i)\\models_{562}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{562}^{\\mathsf H}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{562}^{\\mathsf H}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{562}\">\\(M=(W,R,g,V)\\in\\mathsf{HMod}_{562}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{562}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{562}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{562}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{562}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是两个公式构造子和三类混合公理/规则对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{nom}(i)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\n\\qquad\ni\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{sat}(i,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{nom}(i)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\n\\qquad\ni\\in\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{sat}(i,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{562}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat1}^{562}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat2}^{562}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bridge}^{562}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{562},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Name}^{562}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat1}^{562}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sat2}^{562}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Bridge}^{562}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{562},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{562}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{562}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562},\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562},\n\\operatorname{FN}_{562},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{562},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,562},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{562},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{562},\n\\operatorname{last}_{562},\n\\vdash_{562},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{562},\n\\mathsf{HMod}_{562},\n\\models_{562},\n\\models_{562}^{\\mathsf H}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H_{562}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{562},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{562},\n\\operatorname{NV}_{562},\n\\operatorname{FN}_{562},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{562},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,562},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{562},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Name}^{562},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{562},\n\\operatorname{last}_{562},\n\\vdash_{562},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{562},\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{562},\n\\mathsf{HMod}_{562},\n\\models_{562},\n\\models_{562}^{\\mathsf H}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含混合逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、带名元赋值的 Kripke 模型和语义后承；不含双模拟理论或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由名字与替换","text":"3. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-行证书","text":"8. 行证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-混合-Kripke-语义载体与后承","text":"9. 混合 Kripke 语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{562}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Nom}_{562}=\\{i_k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{nom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box},\\operatorname{sat}.","display":true},{"tex":